  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><strong><u>About us</u></strong></p><p>Dewkes is an independent UK dog food brand built on one simple belief: Dogs deserve better.</p><p>Founded in Wales in 2021, what started as a family-run, local pet store has now turned into a national brand,  providing dogs and their owners with tasty, healthy treats at home and in hospitality venues and retailers across the UK.</p><p><strong><u>Our products</u></strong></p><p>Our product range includes natural, high protein treats, grain-free dog food, and thoughtful dog gift boxes.</p><p>Everything is natural, grain-free and hypoallergenic. We try to keep the number of ingredients to a minimum, and ensure no fillers, artificial ingredients or nasties are included. Meaning they’re kind on tummies but big on taste. </p><p><strong><u>How affiliates can earn</u></strong></p><p>Affiliates earn 10% commission on all sales generated through Dewkes.co.uk. With a growing range of products and strong appeal to dog owners, it’s a great opportunity to earn by recommending products you genuinely love.</p><p><strong><u>How to promote us</u></strong></p><p>You can promote Dewkes through blogs, social media, product reviews, gift guides, newsletters, and dog-focused communities. Our products work especially well in dog lifestyle, pet care and outdoor living content.</p><p><strong><u>Other information</u></strong></p><p>We’re always excited to work with passionate dog lovers who want to share great products with their audience. Join the Dewkes pack and help more dogs (and their humans) discover Dewkes.</p></div>",
